Topology-aware victim selection for cohort reclaim and preemption.

Fixes https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kueue/issues/10815: when the victims
Kueue picks by priority are spread across topology domains, the plan fails the
TAS check and nothing is preempted. When ordinary preemption frees enough quota
but no topology placement, and fails at every pod count partial admission
tries, the scheduler retries once at the full count by freeing whole placements
and picks the one whose victims cost the least.

Builds on the upstream draft https://github.com/kubernetes-sigs/kueue/pull/17834.

